[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5232646711","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122239#issuecomment-5232646711","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122239","id":5232646711,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABN-PaNw","user":{"login":"zedarvates","id":128614184,"node_id":"U_kgDOB6p_KA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128614184?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zedarvates","html_url":"https://github.com/zedarvates","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zedarvates/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zedarvates/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zedarvates/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zedarvates/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zedarvates/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zedarvates/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zedarvates/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zedarvates/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zedarvates/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-09T16:52:56Z","updated_at":"2026-08-09T16:52:56Z","body":"Source diagnosis against the reported 4.7.1 commit: the local [interaction_profile_array](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/a13da4feb/modules/openxr/openxr_interface.cpp#L330-L380) contains OpenXRInteractionProfile resources. After creating RID ip at line 336, the cleanup bookkeeping block at lines 377-380 checks interaction_profile_array.has(ip) and would append the RID to that same local resource array. It never populates the member Vector<RID> interaction_profiles that [free_interaction_profiles](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/a13da4feb/modules/openxr/openxr_interface.cpp#L661-L668) iterates. Current master has the same code. This matches the MRP exactly: zero configured profiles gives zero leaked RIDs; one profile gives one leaked RID. A likely correction is to append ip once to the member interaction_profiles vector, guarded against duplicates. This is a source-level diagnosis; I have not runtime-tested a patched engine yet.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5232646711/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5240764357","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122239#issuecomment-5240764357","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122239","id":5240764357,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOF-3xQ","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-10T13:12:58Z","updated_at":"2026-08-10T13:12:58Z","body":"Are you using AI tools